> Interpretation and limits

Negative collision counts and nonfinite/out-of-range fractions throw before
shifting or integer conversion. The caller owns randomness and frame state; the
API does not simulate Ethernet traffic or authorize retries after abandonment.

Every figure is saved locally by its complete editable program. No separate
reconstruction supplies algorithm state. Counters describe the selected events,
not elapsed time or peak memory.

